      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What red flags should I watch for when selecting a mover for Bangalore‑to‑Noida relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beware of movers who lack IBA approval, do not provide a GST‑registered invoice, or refuse to show insurance certificates. Unclear pricing, absence of GPS tracking, and missing customer reviews are also warning signs. Choosing a certified provider like Shree Ashirwad eliminates these risks for packers and movers bangalore to noida.</p>
